[{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-061","subject":"生理学","topic":"ミトコンドリアとATP産生","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"酸化的リン酸化によるATP産生の中心となる細胞内構造はどれか。","choices":["リソソーム","ミトコンドリア内膜","ゴルジ装置","核小体","中心体"],"correctIndices":[1],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"電子伝達系とATP合成酵素はミトコンドリア内膜。","explanation":"酸化的リン酸化では、ミトコンドリア内膜の電子伝達系がプロトン勾配を作り、ATP合成酵素がその勾配を利用してATPを産生する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Mitochondria","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK9896/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK26894/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"61","rightsBasis":"細胞生理の一般事実を独自作問。図版・本文は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-062","subject":"生理学","topic":"Ⅰ型筋線維の特性","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"Ⅰ型骨格筋線維の特徴として最も適切なのはどれか。","choices":["疲労しやすくミトコンドリアが少ない","ミオグロビンが少なく白色調である","酸化能力が高く疲労しにくい","解糖系だけでATPを産生する","最大収縮速度が最も速い"],"correctIndices":[2],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"Ⅰ型＝slow oxidative、ミトコンドリア・ミオグロビン豊富、疲労抵抗性。","explanation":"Ⅰ型線維は遅筋・slow oxidative fiberで、ミトコンドリア、ミオグロビン、毛細血管が豊富で酸化能力が高く、持久的活動に適する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Bookshelf Skeletal Muscle Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp250428-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK537139/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK482280/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"60","questionNumber":"62","rightsBasis":"筋生理の一般事実を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R60-AM-063","subject":"生理学","topic":"自律神経の作用","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"副交感神経活動が優位になったときにみられやすい反応はどれか。","c